1
00:00:00,502 --> 00:00:04,142
his Grey's Anatomy online
fan group probably knows.

2
00:00:05,341 --> 00:00:07,071
(Bernadette:)Is it weird we don't?

3
00:00:07,142 --> 00:00:08,442
(Sheldon:)I don't know.

4
00:00:08,510 --> 00:00:11,150
(Howard:)Maybe the surprise
will make it more fun.

5
00:00:11,213 --> 00:00:12,813
(Howard:)Like magic tricks.

6
00:00:12,881 --> 00:00:14,621
(Howard:)Remember how disappointed
you were

7
00:00:14,683 --> 00:00:17,253
(Howard:)when I explained
the never-ending hanky?

8
00:00:17,319 --> 00:00:19,489
(Bernadette:)I was disappointed to see
the man I was engaged to

9
00:00:19,555 --> 00:00:22,625
(Bernadette:)pulling rainbow scarves
out of his fly.

10
00:00:24,126 --> 00:00:27,326
But how delightful
was it when I pulled out

11
00:00:27,396 --> 00:00:29,896
(Howard:)a bouquet
at the end of those scarves?

12
00:00:29,965 --> 00:00:32,235
(Howard:)It'll be the same thing

13
00:00:32,301 --> 00:00:36,101
(Howard:)when the doctor pulls
a beautiful surprise out of you.

14
00:00:37,373 --> 00:00:40,573
(Bernadette:)Everyone said I could do better.

15
00:00:40,643 --> 00:00:43,743
(Howard:)But you didn't listen,
and presto change-o,

16
00:00:43,812 --> 00:00:46,112
my baby's inside you. Ta-da!

17
00:00:56,425 --> 00:01:07,025
(Amy (off):)Ugh. What is that?

